{"t":"Rokyn","s":"rokyn-4ae95","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rokyn</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVenore\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145804&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33021,32053,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33021, 32053, 6)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dwarf</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Banker</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221213200927&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rokyn_278ad8.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Rokyn.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Don't run into the mines with too much money in your pockets. Better leave it here.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Above <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>'s second <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>His full name is Rokyn Pursesniffer, son of Fire, from the Molten Rock.<br/>He runs the bank in <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>. Rokyn can exchange <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coins</a>. You can deposit, withdraw, and transfer money with him as well as check your account balance.<br/>\n<b>Note:</b> When Elves from <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">Shadowthorn</a> have <a href=\"#/quest/bank-robbery-mini-world-change\">robbed the Venorean bank</a>, Rokyn will utter a different sound, namely \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">Those lousy treehuggers! By Durin's beard!</span>\"\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["bank-robbery-mini-world-change"],"pos":{"x":33021,"y":32053,"z":6}}